# DMGAssist list: Restoration Shaman damage between heals (learned from Method's guide, patch 12.1.5)
# Written by DMGAssist, not SimulationCraft. Totems and heals stay the player's call; Lava Burst with Lava Surge.
actions.precombat=snapshot_stats
actions=flame_shock,if=!dot.flame_shock.ticking|dot.flame_shock.refreshable
actions+=/lava_burst
actions+=/chain_lightning,if=active_enemies>=3
actions+=/lightning_bolt
